    "sub_name": "室內裝修法規",
    "sub_ename": "INTERIOR  DESIGN  REGULATION",
    "describe_ch": "為維護公共安全、公共衛生、環境品質及市容觀瞻，建築從規劃、設計、施工、使用到拆除都必需受到政府法規的許可管理。除建築行為的管理法規外，不同使用目的之主管機關對建築亦訂有不同的管理法規，加上不同的法規位階，架構出複雜的法規體系制度。本課程目的在使學生了解建築法令規章中與室內裝修相關的條文與規定。",
    "describe_eh": "In order to safeguard public security , public health , environmental quality and appearance of the city, building from planning, design , construct , must permit managing by the government regulation to remove. Besides management regulation of the behavior of the building , use the competent authority of the purpose to also conclude different management regulations to the building differently, adding different regulation location steps, the complicated regulation system happens in the structure. Issue make use of copies of course set up architectural discipline regulation ability that need possess , train student correct regulation idea and good legal system accomplishment.",
